  "technique": "Step 1: Bottleneck Analysis and Utilization Evaluation (Roofline Model)",
  "what": "Before optimizing, **you must first determine whether the operator is compute-bound or memory-bound**, as this determines the subsequent optimization direction and utilization evaluation metrics.",
  "when": "Before optimizing, **you must first determine whether the operator is compute-bound or memory-bound**, as this determines the subsequent optimization direction and utilization evaluation metrics.",
